Jack is always excited about sunday. It is favourite day, when he gets to play all day.
And goes to cycling with his friends. So every time when the months starts he counts the number of sundays he will get to enjoy.
Considering the month can start with any day, be it Sunday, Monday…. Or so on.

Count the number of Sunday jack will get within n number of days.

Solution:

weekday = {"Mon":6,"Tue":5,"Wed":4,"Thu":3,"Fri":2,"Sat":1,"Sunday":7}
start_day = input("Enter the weekday: ")
no_days = int(input("Enter the no of days: "))
tot_sun = 1
no_days = no_days - weekday[start_day]
while no_days :
    if no_days - weekday[start_day] <= 0:
        break
    
    no_days = no_days - weekday["Sunday"]
    tot_sun+=1
    
print("Total Sunday to enjoy !",tot_sun)
    
